:%02d - %s%s<br>␀<span style='font-family:monospace;font-size:13px'>␀</p><form method='POST' action='/clearcrash'><button type='submit' style='background:#555;color:#eee'>␀␀</button></form>␀␀␀␀<h3>WiFi</h3><p>␀␀␀␀<p style='color:#aaa;margin:0'>␀</p><form method='POST' action='/wifiportal'><button type='submit' style='background:#444;color:#eee'>␀␀</button></form><form method='POST' action='/wififorget' onsubmit="return confirm('␀')"><button type='submit' style='background:#6a2a1f;color:#eee'>␀␀␀␀<input name='lat' id='lat' inputmode='decimal' value='␀␀<input name='lon' id='lon' inputmode='decimal' value='␀␀'><button type='button' id='ipb' style='background:#444;color:#eee'>␀␀␀␀</button><p id='ipr' style='color:#aaa;margin:0'></p><label>␀␀␀␀</label><select id='tzs' style='font-size:18px;width:100%;margin:14px 0'>␀␀␀<option value='␀' data-iana='␀␀␀</option>␀␀␀<option value=''␀␀␀␀</option></select><input name='tz' id='tz' value='␀␀<h3>Nyelv / Language</h3><select name='lang' style='font-size:18px;width:100%;margin:14px 0'>␀␀␀<label style='display:block'><input type='checkbox' name='n_on'␀<input type='hidden' name='cam_f' value='1'><label style='display:block'><input type='checkbox' name='cam'␀␀ style='width:auto;margin:0 8px 0 0'>␀␀␀<input name='nt_t' maxlength='64' pattern='[A-Za-z0-9_-]*' value='␀␀<label style='display:block'><input type='checkbox' name='nt_b%d'%s style='width:auto;margin:0 8px 0 0'>%s</label>␀␀<input type='hidden' name='snd_f' value='1'><label style='display:block'><input type='checkbox' name='snd'␀␀<select name='sndv' id='sndv' style='font-size:18px;width:100%;margin:14px 0'>␀␀</select><button type='button' id='sndt' style='background:#444;color:#eee'>␀␀␀␀</button><script>(function(){var s=document.getElementById('sndv');function t(){fetch('/beeptest?v='+s.value,{method:'POST'});}s.onchange=t;document.getElementById('sndt').onclick=t;})();</script>␀␀␀␀<input type='hidden' name='en_f' value='1'><label style='display:block'><input type='checkbox' name